# "Whenever YOU discard": Bot1's Hymn to Tourach makes Bot2 discard two cards, and Bot1's Scrounging Skyray gets nothing.
# Bot2 plays its land so no cleanup discard adds to its graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Scrounging Skyray
Swamp
Hymn to Tourach
Mox Jet
Swamp
Swamp x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Scrounging Skyray.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Hymn to Tourach.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Scrounging Skyray.Power = 1
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 2
Bot1.Graveyard = Hymn to Tourach
